{"id":"produccio_n","lemma":"producción","pos":"noun","rank":2162,"glosses":["production","product; output"],"ipa":"/pɾoduɡˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"producciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/eb/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-producci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ya ha empezado la producción.","en":"Production has already begun.","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to start","l":"empezar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La producción siguió aumentando año tras año.","en":"Year after year, production continued to increase.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693120","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to follow","l":"seguir"},{"g":"to increase, grow","l":"aumentar"},{"g":"year"},{"g":"after"},{"g":"year"}]},{"text":"La producción de quesos es un arte.","en":"Making cheese is an art.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"cheese","l":"queso"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"art"}]},{"text":"La producción de esta fábrica ha aumentado un 20%.","en":"The output of this factory has increased by 20%.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/35841","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"factory"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to increase, grow","l":"aumentar"},{"g":"a"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"definitely this time"]]},{"text":"Hicimos una resolución para incrementar la producción.","en":"We made a resolution to increase production.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"resolution"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to increment"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}